1. GRANT
The author grants the individual healthcare professional (nurse, physician
or other healthcare practitioner, natural person) a free, personal,
non-exclusive, non-transferable license to install and use the application
on their own personal devices, as an aid to their own clinical
documentation.

2. PROHIBITED USES
Without the author's prior written agreement, the following are prohibited:
  a) use, adoption or deployment by healthcare companies, hospitals,
     clinics, nursing homes, cooperatives, corporations or any other public
     or private organization, even free of charge;
  b) installation on corporate devices or making the application available
     to the staff of an organization;
  c) selling, reselling, renting, sublicensing or redistributing the
     application or any part of it;
  d) modifying, decompiling, reverse engineering or creating derivative
     works, except as mandatorily permitted by law.

3. NO WARRANTY
The application is provided "as is", without warranties of any kind, express
or implied. It is not a medical device: it provides no diagnosis, treatment
indication or clinical decision support. All clinical decisions and the
related responsibility remain solely with the healthcare professional. To
the maximum extent permitted by law, the author shall not be liable for any
damage arising from the use of, or inability to use, the application.

4. DATA OWNERSHIP
Data entered remains on the user's device; the user is its sole controller
and responsible party under applicable data protection law.

5. INSTITUTIONAL LICENSES
For use by organizations: dev.davide@pm.me
